WEBVTT

00:00:03.409 --> 00:00:04.754
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We’ll offer him the job.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:08.220
I promise to come.

00:00:10.178 --> 00:00:11.817
Can I borrow your car?

00:00:13.729 --> 00:00:15.193
It’ll never happen.

00:00:17.204 --> 00:00:19.086
Please practise the sentences.

00:00:21.089 --> 00:00:22.419
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Second syllable</b>

00:00:23.907 --> 00:00:25.456
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We’ll decide later.

00:00:27.437 --> 00:00:28.637
I don’t agree.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:31.892
When do you arrive?

00:00:33.927 --> 00:00:35.993
They complain about everything.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.645
It’ll depend on the weather.

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.129
Don’t forget your keys.

00:00:45.105 --> 00:00:46.305
Let’s invite her.

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:49.832
Which do you prefer?

00:00:51.855 --> 00:00:53.598
You’ll receive it in a week.

00:00:55.705 --> 00:00:57.460
Can you repair this, please?